598 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Digital Dealer After Hours\n\nThe Digital Dealer Bar Crawl is an evening of networking\054 drinks\054 and a self\055guided tour of some of Detroit\031s most iconic bars\056 Skip the presentations and connect with industry peers in a relaxed setting where great conversations happen naturally\056\n\nJoin us on Day 1 of Digital Dealer\054 September 22\054 starting at 6\07200 PM\056 Registration is free for all Digital Dealer attendees and exhibitors)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 599 0 R
     /Pg 592 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

